  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "On the north of this village, there is an old ",
      "city called, Ruinen. There, the merchants",
      "buy the products from Philai and sell them ",
      "for living. But the Skeletons started to appear",
      "enroute to Ruinen Village for some time now. ",
      "So the merchants are having much difficulties. ",
      "",
      "They need your help urgently. ",
      "Go to Forest of Spirits and hunt 10 Corrupts, ",
      "then go back to Blacksmith Ruga in Ruinen Village.",
      "",
      "[Quest Subject]",
      "     ",
      "     Hunt 10 10 Skeletons in the ",
      "     Forest of Spirits, then go back to  ",
      "     Blacksmith Ruga in Ruinen Village.",
      ""
    ]
  },
